[I] Header-only integer division via fixed-point multiplication

[T] FXdiv is a header-only C99/C++ library that replaces integer division by
[T] a multiplication with a precomputed inverse and two shifts. This speeds
[T] up applications that repeatedly divide by the same divisor and is used
[T] by thread pool and neural network libraries such as pthreadpool and
[T] XNNPACK.

[U] https://github.com/Maratyszcza/FXdiv

[A] Maratyszcza
[M] andrei32 <andrei32.t2@gmail.com>

[C] extra/tool
[F] CROSS

[L] MIT
